-border/40 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary/20"></div></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Full Sports Metadata</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Teams, players, standings, rosters, venues, colors, TV broadcasts, and so much more.</p><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/[0.04] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl p-6 transition-all duration-400 border border-border/45 bg-card/47 backdrop-blur-sm hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-white/[0.12] hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/15 to-transparent transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:via-primary/40"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/20 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2.5"><div class="inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded bg-primary/10 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-history h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path><path d="M12 7v5l4 2"></path></svg></div><div class="h-px flex-1 bg-border/40 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary/20"></div></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Historical Data</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Unlock data from previous seasons (availability varies by league and tier).</p><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/[0.04] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="container pb-24 md:pb-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-12"><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">The Odds API Developers Trust</h2><p class="mt-4 text-balance text-sm text-muted-foreground md:text-lg mx-auto max-w-2xl">Thousands of teams and solo developers trust SportsGameOdds to power their software in production.</p></div><div class="mb-16 grid grid-cols-1 justify-items-center gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:justify-items-stretch md:gap-6"><div class="group w-full max-w-xs rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.08)] sm:max-w-none"><p class="mb-1 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary md:text-5xl">1B+</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">API requests served</p></div><div class="group w-full max-w-xs rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.08)] sm:max-w-none"><p class="mb-1 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary md:text-5xl">99.99%</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Avg Uptime</p></div><div class="group w-full max-w-xs rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.08)] sm:max-w-none"><p class="mb-1 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary md:text-5xl">2019</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Established</p></div></div><div class="mx-auto mb-10 flex min-h-[96px] justify-center"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div><div class="google-reviews-dark min-h-[440px] xl:min-h-[360px]"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div></section><section class="container pb-24 md:pb-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-12"><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Try it Out</h2><p class="mt-4 text-balance text-sm text-muted-foreground md:text-lg mx-auto max-w-2xl">See live odds for an upcoming game</p></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl"><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-[#0d1320] shadow-2xl overflow-hidden"><div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3 bg-[#111827] border-b border-border"><div class="flex gap-1.5"><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#ef4444]/80"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b]/80"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#22c55e]/80"></div></div><span class="text-xs text-muted-text ml-3 font-mono">SportsGameOdds API</span></div><div class="p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="shrink-0 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-primary/15 text-primary text-xs font-bold font-mono tracking-wide">GET</span><code class="flex-1 text-sm font-mono text-foreground/80 truncate">https://api.sportsgameodds.com/v2/events</code><button class="shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-gradient-start via-gradient-mid to-gradient-end text-white text-sm font-medium shadow-brand hover:shadow-brand-hover hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 transition-all disabled:opacity-60 disabled:transform-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play w-4 h-4"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg><span>Send</span></button></div></div><div class="h-px bg-border mx-4"></div><div class="px-4 py-4"><h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-text uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Request Parameters</h3><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><div class="rounded-lg bg-[#111827] border border-border/60 px-3.5 py-2.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-0.5"><code class="text-xs font-mono text-accent">leagueID</code><span class="text-muted-text text-[10px]">=</span><code class="text-xs font-mono text-foreground">NFL</code></div><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-text">Only NBA games</p></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-[#111827] border border-border/60 px-3.5 py-2.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-0.5"><code class="text-xs font-mono text-accent">oddsAvailable</code><span class="text-muted-text text-[10px]">=</span><code class="text-xs font-mono text-foreground">true</code></div><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-text">Only games with available odds</p></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-[#111827] border border-border/60 px-3.5 py-2.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-0.5"><code class="text-xs font-mono text-accent">includeAltLines</code><span class="text-muted-text text-[10px]">=</span><code class="text-xs font-mono text-foreground">false</code></div><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-text">Don&#x27;t return alt-lines</p></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-[#111827] border border-border/60 px-3.5 py-2.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-0.5"><code class="text-xs font-mono text-accent">limit</code><span class="text-muted-text text-[10px]">=</span><code class="text-xs font-mono text-foreground">1</code></div><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-text">Number of games to return</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="container pb-24 md:pb-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-12"><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">What will you build?</h2><p class="mt-4 text-balance text-sm text-muted-foreground md:text-lg mx-auto max-w-2xl">Developers and teams use SportsGameOdds to power tools, platforms, and services across the sports betting ecosystem.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-8 transition-all duration-300 lg:col-span-2 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(16,185,129,0.08)]"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/60 to-transparent"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/[0.03] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary/15"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up h-6 w-6"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">+EV &amp; Arbitrage Tools</h3><p class="mb-5 text-[0.938rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Build tools that find profitable betting opportunities by comparing real-time odds across bookmakers. Surface value bets, identify arbitrage windows, and shop for the best lines.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Value Betting Scanners</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Arbitrage Finders</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Line Shopping Tools</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Kelly Criterion Calculators</span></div></div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-8 transition-all duration-300 lg:col-span-2 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(16,185,129,0.08)]"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-primary/60 to-transparent"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/[0.03] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary/15"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layout-dashboard h-6 w-6"><rect width="7" height="9" x="3" y="3" rx="1"></rect><rect width="7" height="5" x="14" y="3" rx="1"></rect><rect width="7" height="9" x="14" y="12" rx="1"></rect><rect width="7" height="5" x="3" y="16" rx="1"></rect></svg></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Odds &amp; Betting Platforms</h3><p class="mb-5 text-[0.938rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Build platforms that help users compare odds, track bets, and discover picks — with deep links straight to the sportsbook.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Odds Comparison Sites</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Bet Trackers</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Picks &amp; Tips Platforms</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Sportsbook Aggregators</span></div></div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(16,185,129,0.08)]"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/[0.03] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary/15"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trophy h-5 w-5"><path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"></path><path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"></path><path d="M4 22h16"></path><path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"></path><path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"></path><path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Fantasy Sports &amp; DFS</h3><p class="mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Power lineup optimizers and player prop tools with real-time odds and stats across DraftKings, FanDuel, and more.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Lineup Optimizers</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Player Prop Analysis</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Contest Selection Tools</span></div></div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(16,185,129,0.08)]"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/[0.03] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary/15"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-newspaper h-5 w-5"><path d="M4 22h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Zm0 0a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-9c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h2"></path><path d="M18 14h-8"></path><path d="M15 18h-5"></path><path d="M10 6h8v4h-8V6Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Sports Media &amp; Content</h3><p class="mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Embed live odds on sports articles, power &quot;best bets&quot; editorial sections, and build interactive odds widgets for content sites.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Odds Widgets</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Editorial Best Bets</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Live Line Displays</span></div></div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(16,185,129,0.08)]"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/[0.03] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary/15"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-code h-5 w-5"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Side Projects &amp; Bots</h3><p class="mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Perfect for Discord bots, personal dashboards, academic research, and proof-of-concept builds.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Discord Bots</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Personal Dashboards</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-elevated/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-foreground-secondary transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-primary/20 group-hover:text-foreground/80">Academic Research</span></div></div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(16,185,129,0.08)]"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/[0.03] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary/15"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-bar h-5 w-5"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M7 16h8"></path><path d="M7 11h12"></path><path d="M7 6h3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Prediction Markets</h3><p class="mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Aggregate odds from both traditional sportsbooks and prediction m