offset-2 border-transparent bg-primary/10 text-primary w-fit text-[0.6875rem]">Odds API</span><div class="mt-auto flex items-center justify-between pt-2 text-[0.6875rem] text-muted-foreground"><span>Aug 26, 2026</span><span class="flex items-center gap-0.5 text-primary opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100">Read <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></a><a class="group" href="/blog/college-football-odds-api-guide"><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(16,185,129,0.1)]"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100 from-accent via-primary to-highlight"></div><div class="relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden"><img alt="How to Pull College Football Odds and Player Props" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.05]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 320px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fblog%2Fcollege-football-odds-api-guide%2FcoverImage.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-card/80 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary">How to Pull College Football Odds and Player Props</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A practical walkthrough of querying college football odds from the SportsGameOdds API: the NCAAF leagueID, prop oddIDs, pulling the NFL and college board together, and keeping a full Saturday slate fast.</p><span data-slot="badge" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent bg-primary/10 text-primary w-fit text-[0.6875rem]">Football Odds API</span><div class="mt-auto flex items-center justify-between pt-2 text-[0.6875rem] text-muted-foreground"><span>Aug 26, 2026</span><span class="flex items-center gap-0.5 text-primary opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100">Read <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" cla